            <ArticleTitle>Care Bundles: Increasing Consistency of Care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>45-48</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/NOR.0000000000000311</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Care bundling is a strategy for reliably delivering quality, evidence-based care for patients undergoing treatments known to be accompanied by potential risks. This article reviews the purpose, types, and components of care bundles, as well as the process for development and implementation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
